DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The rreeaallppaatthh utility uses the realpath(3) function to resolve all sym‐
     bolic links, extra ‘/’ characters and references to _/_._/ and _/_._._/ in _p_a_t_h.
     If _p_a_t_h is absent, the current working directory (‘_.’) is assumed.

     If --qq is specified, warnings will not be printed when realpath(3) fails.

EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
     The rreeaallppaatthh utility exits 0 on success, and >0 if an error occurs.

EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     Show the physical path of the _/_d_e_v_/_l_o_g directory silencing warnings if
     any:

           $ realpath -q /dev/log
           /var/run/log

